## Key Findings

1. **Pipeline Success**: End-to-end execution from API fetch to WFA analysis completed
2. **Limited Trades**: Only 3 trades generated - conservative RSI parameters (30/70) missed signals in trending market
3. **Negative Performance**: Strategy underperformed during this period (negative Sharpe)
4. **Baseline Established**: First real-data experiment, improving evidence score from 25 → 35

---

## Improvements Identified

1. Use wider RSI oversold/overbought bands (e.g., 20/80) to generate more trades
2. Test SMA crossover strategy on same data for comparison
3. Fetch additional crypto pairs (ETHUSDT, SOLUSDT)
4. Expand param grid to include more aggressive RSI settings

